    description: "상세요강 [한국하니웰] Sr. Advanced Project Engineer (Gas Detector분야) 📋 주요업무 • Support product and project development activities to deliver high-quality, competitive products on schedule through effective planning, scope definition, cost estimation, and execution strategies. • Lead projects throughout the entire lifecycle, from concept definition and planning through development, verification, product launch, commercialization, and project closeout. • Lead and manage cross-functional project teams to successfully execute projects with budgets exceeding \$10M USD. • Manage resource allocation and staffing plans to ensure the right skills are assigned to meet project complexity and business objectives. • Drive effective communication across project teams, regional execution organizations, customers, suppliers, and channel partners to achieve project goals and promote best practice sharing. • Collaborate closely with teams in the U.S., India, China and Europe to maintain global consistency in NPI processes, engineering standards, and project execution methodologies. • Provide accurate weekly, monthly, and quarterly project status reporting in accordance with established governance and work processes. • Concise conversational manners that get straight to the point without unnecessary details. • Implement and manage project change control and closeout processes, ensuring all baseline changes are properly documented, approved, and tracked, while capturing lessons learned and driving continuous improvement recommendations. 📋 자격요건 * Must Have: • BA/BS degree or equivalent practical experience • Have at least 8 years of program / project management experience (wall to wall project delivery experience in Gas detection / Manufacturing / Engineering preferred) • Fluent in English - reading, writing and presentation * Preferred : • PM related certificate (Ex : PMP, Prince II, Agile related certifications….etc) • Have good understanding/experience in manufacturing/IT industry • Engineering background is preferred • Strong project and program management skills as well as excellent communication skills with good logic 🏠 근무조건 • 고용형태 : 정규직 • 급여 : 면접 후 결정 • 근무지 : 서울 마포구 월드컵북로 434 상암 IT Tower • 근무일수/시간 : 🎁 복지 및 혜택 • 교육/생활 : 교육비 지원, 자기계발비 지원, 사내동호회 운영, 사우회(경조사회), 식비 지원, 음료제공(차,커피) • 리프레시 : 연차, 경조휴가제, 창립일휴무, 근로자의날 휴무, 산전 후 휴가, 육아휴직, 남성출산휴가 • 급여제도 : 퇴직연금, 인센티브제, 장기근속자 포상, 우수사원포상, 4대 보험 • 지원금/보험 : 건강검진, 의료비지원(본인), 직원대출제도, 각종 경조사 지원, 단체 상해보험, 의료비지원(가족), 본인학자금, 통신비 지원, 자녀학자금 • 출퇴근 : 차량유류비지급, 통근버스 운행, 주차장제공 • 조직 문화 : 노조/노사협의회 • 선물 : 명절선물/귀향비 • 근무 환경 : 수유실, 휴게실, 회의실, 공기청정기, 카페테리아, 스마트기기, 노트북, 사원증, 사무용품 지급 🚀 채용절차 접수기간 : 2026-09-01 16시 ~ 2026-10-01 24시 제출서류 : 사람인 온라인 이력서 접수방법 : 사람인 입사지원 전형절차 : 서류전형 → 1차면접 → 2차면접 → 최종합격 🛎️ 유의사항 • 입사지원 서류에 허위사실이 발견될 경우, 채용확정 이후라도 채용이 취소될 수 있습니다.",
